repository-code: "https://github.com/mikesupo/cavescript32-signs"
url: "https://suposystem.ai/cavescript/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  The 32 signs of CaveScript32 as individual SVG drawings in a common 48 x 48 frame,
  named by the sign IDs (S00-S31) used by the CaveScript32 reference codec, with a
  manifest, the original source PDF and a reproducible extraction script.
keywords:
  - CaveScript32
  - sign drawings
  - SVG
  - conscript
  - writing system
  - Upper Paleolithic geometric signs
references:
